  "description": "NITGAB crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C76 H132 Er6 N2 O34. From the CIF bond table, Er1 (Er) has 8 O neighbors; Er2 (Er) has 8 O neighbors; Er3 (Er) has 8 O neighbors; Er1B (Er) has 8 O neighbors; Er2B (Er) has 8 O neighbors; Er3B (Er) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 9 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.525-4.323 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 94.38-141.07°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C76H130Er6N2O34. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
